<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-TENERIFE AND FEYENOORD DRAW 0-0 IN UEFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TENERIFE AND FEYENOORD DRAW 0-0 IN UEFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>TENERIFE, Spain</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tenerife of Spain and Feyenoord of the Netherlands drew their UEFA Cup third round first leg match 0-0 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Attendance 19.000.</p>
</text>
